      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the veterinary staff for their calming, attentive handling of dogs and cats during exams. Pet parents report that even anxious or sensitive animals remain comfortable throughout checkups, routine shots, and physical evaluations. Clients appreciate feeling that their pets receive thoughtful, compassionate attention."
      }
    },
