        "en": "Pet owners report strong satisfaction with treatment outcomes across wellness checkups, routine surgeries, diagnostic evaluations, and dental care. Clients value receiving practical medical recommendations that keep their companion animals healthy. One reviewer reported seeking a second opinion regarding a diagnostic evaluation."
